.claude
.env*
docs
scripts
infra
evals
specs
tests
.venv
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
.import_linter_cache
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
uv.lock
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile*
Makefile
*.md
!README.md
tmp
dist
build
